La mission couvre typiquement les volets fourniture, accompagnement : mission & Vision, core Values, leading the Way in Sustainable Solar and Industrial Solutions, driven by Innovation, Reliability, and Sustainability. BK INTERNATIONAL intervient à Casablanca, pour entreprises, en mission nationale et internationale. Le tarif est établi sur devis, selon l''échelle et les phases confiées. Un accompagnement à distance est également possible.', 'Matériaux & équipements', 'https://bkinternational.ma/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/NEW-BLOG-02-1170x684-1-r1cmvftm9wyphwe8qc0pu543fw452uysb2cayjkq7e.jpg', '["https://bkinternational.ma/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/20180807101101-shutterstock-2851762491-768x512.webp", "https://bkinternational.ma/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/26962_1-2048x1362.jpg", "https://bkinternational.ma/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/20180807101101-shutterstock-2851762491-600x400.webp", "https://bkinternational.ma/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/panneaux-photovoltaique-financement-agriculteur-uai-1440x954-1-min-300x199.jpg", "https://bkinternational.ma/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/26962_1-768x511.jpg", "https://bkinternational.ma/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/26962_1-1024x681.jpg", "https://bkinternational.ma/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/panneaux-photovoltaique-financement-agriculteur-uai-1440x954-1-min-1024x678.jpg", "https://bkinternational.ma/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/panneaux-photovoltaique-financement-agriculteur-uai-1440x954-1-min-768x509.jpg"]'::jsonb, '["Fourniture", "Accompagnement"]'::jsonb, '["Mission & Vision", "Core Values", "Leading the Way in Sustainable Solar and Industrial Solutions", "Driven by Innovation, Reliability, and Sustainability", "We’ve 16 Years Of Experience", "Need any help?"]'::jsonb, '["Livraison chantier", "Accompagnement poseur", "Gamme décorative"]'::jsonb, 'devis', NULL, NULL, 'villes', '["Casablanca"]'::jsonb, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, '["Entreprises"]'::jsonb, NULL, '["International", "National"]'::jsonb);
